            <ArticleTitle>Biliary stent migration causing perforation of the caecum and chronic abdominal pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1136/bcr-2013-009124</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">bcr2013009124</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of biliary stent migration causing perforation of the caecum and presenting as chronic abdominal pain. The case was managed by colonoscopic removal of the stent.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
